================================================================================
Attribution
================================================================================

This library is a Kotlin Multiplatform reimplementation of the scraping logic of
the `ani-cli` shell script:

    ani-cli — https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli
    Copyright (C) its contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3

The original project is the source of the protocol knowledge that this library
encodes: the request sequence of the upstream site, the way the player
configuration is obfuscated, and the behaviour of the quality selection.

The implementation itself — the model, the ports and adapters, the parsers, the
network layer, the storage layer and the playback engines — was written from
scratch for this project.

Upstream's disclaimer applies to this project as well:

    The core aim of this project is to co-relate automation and efficiency to
    extract what is provided to a user on the internet. All content available
    through the project is hosted by external non-affiliated sources.

    This project is to be used at the user's own risk, based on their
    government and laws. This project has no control on the content it is
    serving, using copyrighted content from the providers is not going to be
    accounted for by the developer. It is the user's own risk.

This library resolves links to third party content. It does not ship, host or
cache any copyrighted material itself.


